WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.080 align:start position:19%
Do you need to fill the house with the
young blood I requested? Better for me.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:11.360 align:start position:19%
Was your old house too small for the
growing family? Or was it greed to bring

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.360 align:start position:19%
me your children?

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:18.360 align:start position:19%
Once I know their names, I will call to
them, and I will draw them to me.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:23.240 align:start position:19%
Derek stopped sleeping.
Maria cried every single night. They

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:26.760 align:start position:19%
hired a private investigator.
The investigator dug up something the

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:30.880 align:start position:19%
police had missed. The previous owners
had been hiding something, too.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:36.480 align:start position:19%
The Woods family had lived in that house
for 23 years. Days before the sale

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:40.960 align:start position:19%
closed, they got a letter.
